---
{
  title: "no_ansi"
}
---
### NAME

    no_ansi() - Returns a string with all colour removed.

### SYNOPSIS

    string no_ansi( string str );

### DESCRIPTION

    Returns a string with all colour removed.

### PARAMETERS

    str  (string)
         The string to remove colour from.

### RETURN VALUES

    (string) The string without colour.
